                    <td style="padding:16px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(24,24,24,.14);">Improved skin relief and deep furrows in a six-month trial<a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12823436/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><sup>3</sup></a>
</td>
                    <td style="padding:16px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(24,24,24,.14);">Months of steady use</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding:16px 14px;font-weight:700;">Work as a hydrator?</td>
                    <td style="padding:16px 14px;">Hydration improved equally on vitamin C and placebo-treated skin<a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37128827/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><sup>5</sup></a>
</td>
                    <td style="padding:16px 14px;">Pair it with a moisturiser</td>
                </tr>
